# 统一换行策略：文本文件以 LF 入仓（core.autocrlf 不再将工作区转换为 CRLF）。
* text=auto
*.md text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.bin binary
*.onnx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
